# Extra flags for scripts/check-public-repo-secrets.py in the CI scan workflows,
# one per line. This repo is public, so a scan that could not look must fail.
--require-public
# .secret-blocklist holds opaque tokens whose literals live only in the
# maintainer's private harness; a published public mirror cannot hold that
# mapping, so CI matches the tokens verbatim (the pre-commit hook on the
# maintainer's machine expands them in full).
--allow-degraded-blocklist
